OL,3,GNEWSABiologist taking on climate change
OL,4,Awith new maize
OL,5,
OL,6,F"As climate change makes drought and
OL,7,Fwater shortage an increasingly
OL,8,Fimportant constraint on crop
OL,9,Fproduction, we need to rethink how
OL,10,Fmaize varieties are developed," said
OL,11,FFerguson.
